# Burn & Build purchase email

Transactional email sent after diet purchase (Resend). Attaches the personalized Burn & Build Diet PDF and links to the download portal + free resources.

**User-facing copy is locked** — do not reauthor. See `.cursor/rules/user-authored-copy.mdc`.

## Naming (locked)

| Layer | Name | Example |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Subject** | `Your Burn & Build Diet + Resources` | Resend `subject` |
| **Preview label** | Burn & Build Purchase Email | Docs, agent context |
| **Download filename** | `burn-and-build-purchase-email.html` | `Content-Disposition` attachment |
| **Repo static file** | `docs/samples/burn-and-build-purchase-email.html` | Commit after `npm run preview:diet-email` |
| **GitHub Pages preview** | `/purchase-email-preview/` | Safari-safe review URL |
| **API slug** | `burn-and-build-purchase-email` | `GET /api/samples/burn-and-build-purchase-email` |
| **npm script** | `preview:diet-email` | Regenerates preview HTML |

Constants: `js/dietEmailPreviewNamingHelpers.js`, public URLs in `js/siteUrls.js`.

**Do not create** alternate preview paths (`previews/diet-email/`, `diet-email-preview` API slug, `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` for user downloads).

## Preview URL (after push to `main`)

**Review in Safari** — paste in address bar:

```
https://burnandbuilddiet.com/purchase-email-preview/
```

**API download** (attachment):

```
https://program-creator-3tzd.onrender.com/api/samples/burn-and-build-purchase-email
```

Inline in browser: same API URL with `?inline=1`

## Visual system (no blue)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Page background | `#F3F3F3` | Outside the card |
| Card | `#FFFFFF` | Reading area |
| Black | `#0A0A0A` | Body, headings, portal link |
| Gold | `#FDC500` | KEEP THIS EMAIL, resource links, accents |
| Keep tint | `#FFFBE6` | Keep-this callout background |

Links use gold or black with gold underline — **never default blue**. Safari overrides require `!important` and `-webkit-text-fill-color` on `<a>` tags.

## Email structure

1. Logo → greeting → purchase confirmation
2. **KEEP THIS EMAIL** — portal return link (not a giant CTA); diet PDF attached
3. **Free Resources** — Menu Plan Worksheet + Burn & Build FAQ (equal weight, gold download links)
4. Support → **— Kory** (Caveat signature, ~30px, dark gray) → Burn & Build → *Athlete-tested since 1982*

